    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up. It\u2019s quiet. Too quiet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store is locked. The lights flicker. Something's wrong outside\u2014and maybe inside too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ellie, a girl trapped in a store after the world takes a strange, haunting turn. As you explore, you'll uncover fragments of what happened, confront eerie events, and make choices that shape the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/7f76a74e6a13649ac29e2d2025ac3004.poster.avif?t=1753816714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/7f76a74e6a13649ac29e2d2025ac3004.webm?t=1753816714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/7f76a74e6a13649ac29e2d2025ac3004.mp4?t=1753816714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game about fighting. It\u2019s about listening. Watching. Feeling the dread creep in as reality slips further away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A suspenseful, story-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching narrative with meaningful choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet horror and psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric visuals and immersive sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by your decisions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/c6bdd1cd4d86a10918128311c24bf6f5.poster.avif?t=1753816714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/c6bdd1cd4d86a10918128311c24bf6f5.webm?t=1753816714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/c6bdd1cd4d86a10918128311c24bf6f5.mp4?t=1753816714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every path leads somewhere darker. Will you find the truth\u2014or become part of the mystery?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up. It\u2019s quiet. Too quiet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store is locked. The lights flicker. Something's wrong outside\u2014and maybe inside too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ellie, a girl trapped in a store after the world takes a strange, haunting turn. As you explore, you'll uncover fragments of what happened, confront eerie events, and make choices that shape the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/7f76a74e6a13649ac29e2d2025ac3004.poster.avif?t=1753816714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/7f76a74e6a13649ac29e2d2025ac3004.webm?t=1753816714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/7f76a74e6a13649ac29e2d2025ac3004.mp4?t=1753816714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game about fighting. It\u2019s about listening. Watching. Feeling the dread creep in as reality slips further away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A suspenseful, story-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching narrative with meaningful choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet horror and psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric visuals and immersive sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by your decisions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/c6bdd1cd4d86a10918128311c24bf6f5.poster.avif?t=1753816714\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/c6bdd1cd4d86a10918128311c24bf6f5.webm?t=1753816714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838300/extras/c6bdd1cd4d86a10918128311c24bf6f5.mp4?t=1753816714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every path leads somewhere darker. Will you find the truth\u2014or become part of the mystery?</strong></p>",
